  "bundle_request_count": 18,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:0b348581e0c69973c592d69b27d592b5ca7cde1db9e0cf516ba56b627c01f6e0",
      "request_id": "0b348581e0c69973c592d69b27d592b5ca7cde1db9e0cf516ba56b627c01f6e0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "01ee08b93cf494bb55fbb1d7d9b9e70b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "资格到手之后，他又两盘击败马哈奇，继续巴黎的征程。法国男网时隔十年，终于又有人入围年终。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "01ca48d89ee7a324e9c71d22e722c9a3440b8757262b1683bcc420de29fafb87",
      "words_sha256": "37f157f3ffef33a14db8223433c24262540b45b281b203ff8b844df12724459f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1aba740bf7f15b5ddc48d94b04523cca5fc54c359d44673a5c5991fd004be893",
      "request_id": "1aba740bf7f15b5ddc48d94b04523cca5fc54c359d44673a5c5991fd004be893",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "25248528bcf301d404243d84f3907798",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "复出第三站，多哈。他一路打到决赛，却以二比六、一比六输给阿尔卡拉斯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ead8be5bd892ed7882447feb8a5b887522109897dcd079fa060a86aa1101fab7",
      "words_sha256": "af1758c1db2266bdb7d184a8e8a628deb50652b03d0d52bedc9881c2f2da3abc"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1d326b8bf56fed76f7a0349184c3169dbc24f9422fd5159242f67df49d40e8cf",
      "request_id": "1d326b8bf56fed76f7a0349184c3169dbc24f9422fd5159242f67df49d40e8cf",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "979842dfcdca26812a619fe6c7f40d48",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "截至十一月五日，菲斯三千六百二十五分，排在赛季积分榜第七。高亮的六个人，都已拿到年终门票。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b067e5bd2fb2d271c9d09b00bccd2e3587041717d56f4fb77e14442b1457eec8",
      "words_sha256": "1eff57b7b5c8887d7d3e90f3d0f32c4c33cbcdd93ac260074c193b61470dcb79"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:26f089dbbf46c9d3b769dfd57d3d667cf50a55e3df185d3faaedf68a4eff15d6",
      "request_id": "26f089dbbf46c9d3b769dfd57d3d667cf50a55e3df185d3faaedf68a4eff15d6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "05bc7cd67721621ca909fb8750e5c53f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网，却又在首轮被西西帕斯挡住。辛辛那提的冠军，并没有让大满贯的难题自动消失。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6d12ca1aeb3653e8ee1c393612cf64ada5d231f63245898a50cd32f9551855d4",
      "words_sha256": "0a3aab9546ee395d461bcf05eff9451a25a4ab93ecfe83f7ca56611a13b685e4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:27e9abbdca7612294de277a50e1b6e0f34259fb7f3ecfa2c7c3fe8d6f93df468",
      "request_id": "27e9abbdca7612294de277a50e1b6e0f34259fb7f3ecfa2c7c3fe8d6f93df468",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "98985361b320f41252ebe75928a1dbe3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十一月四日，转折来自另一场比赛。阿利斯击败蒂亚福，菲斯的年终资格提前锁定。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "275164136fb2f4aacbf305fbc6bc572d67d24f192970d43d8e87b14d71156b13",
      "words_sha256": "3e67bdfe7a316a9e4ea28c14b8096250d10f4265d01af6242560162f72dc5650"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4bedf1bb2bba8cc09e6afcc947bb621f7f8e8de28f04c700f86f0d0d91f50b82",
      "request_id": "4bedf1bb2bba8cc09e6afcc947bb621f7f8e8de28f04c700f86f0d0d91f50b82",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b9225812ed5c65cde8804b6ad36fef58",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "印第安维尔斯打进8强。接着是迈阿密，对保罗那场四分之一决赛，他救回四个赛点，三盘抢七翻了回来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "21d84e10918916f669e6827fd379e4ce0ce340651707197f2be1a2eff947c5d8",
      "words_sha256": "e9e6d14e2d42e425c1679df900a94eabad5616260b942e9db72815dec1caea9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6072e20653407427e48a07f28dc34b50120d206336e305dcea1201eae999e4f2",
      "request_id": "6072e20653407427e48a07f28dc34b50120d206336e305dcea1201eae999e4f2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "03267b61a0e0c1e0c9274c1c8d3d9b2e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "温网先赢一轮，第二轮输给贝雷蒂尼。这一胜，也是他今年全部的大满贯胜场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7059c83e609abaa9eb9a53a63c1236e61f16a57b19320d4f763ab286a2c69e46",
      "words_sha256": "2aaf9b4087de99f86a6853e0272d55ce5706d1185a9a1dba1c8732d52efca6df"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:62fbac7805110f7be43b87b755b09ff309d193dd3d9245f266d62f84c4ae11c8",
      "request_id": "62fbac7805110f7be43b87b755b09ff309d193dd3d9245f266d62f84c4ae11c8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8fdbe899728809f523e235d8750bcaa1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "迈阿密止步4强之后，他在巴塞罗那两盘击败卢布列夫。复出后的第一座奖杯，到手了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "42e99bc27f7d3e1cddb73ec8597e1ef1bc605c0cc38d8838e9e0b0ca02cb6c3a",
      "words_sha256": "1476da5cbf15c9207eadec3f68851fa6b8a34479e616752c51abd62ded118c7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6dc630ff237a52aee43736e319bb1815494b69dd22d6ed47ce0a27b17ac10356",
      "request_id": "6dc630ff237a52aee43736e319bb1815494b69dd22d6ed47ce0a27b17ac10356",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "543601b81803674176271fe605e669cb",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "巴塞尔，面对弗里茨，第二盘零比二时，菲斯再次伤退。年终门票还没拿到，他又没能打完比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1b644325e22f3d9dd860e10654c8cf4c7f71cc06f9572643f9044a0c5e7ef89b",
      "words_sha256": "48b7ca210e3f7814dd0f172f05738739b39b4b4c3b514e5b09a3201b0642c6b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:82a648ab01dfc59c7d3a7e9ffcb67051f7dafc4d3f841b3c804dbaade84928b9",
      "request_id": "82a648ab01dfc59c7d3a7e9ffcb67051f7dafc4d3f841b3c804dbaade84928b9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "928200d63b4db8c445cdc353a9cfce30",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "辛辛那提决赛，他与蒂亚福各拿一盘。决胜盘，菲斯送出六比零，拿到生涯第一座大师赛冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5f3410d9e1552254d62bc665154d742423202ef1eb0192793a857f1231697634",
      "words_sha256": "cad428dfcf32204297bd88905e467f0383b928857aed44db403efb8481e48b69"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8333b6df5fc9d0aeedadb07809405b74fe75c0c256d9e792599e5597f1572442",
      "request_id": "8333b6df5fc9d0aeedadb07809405b74fe75c0c256d9e792599e5597f1572442",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d33f6112bbb1a3b51f971fdc0e79c966",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可伤病再次打断了他。罗马首战伤退，随后因为髋伤退出法网。两个大满贯，他都没能出场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d9ae3f34769f382b41b825642700fdc2a3e5443a538a48b101b4580a847fb8c6",
      "words_sha256": "939ad6e4fcd671fb7ab3e7f17f16ed7f4493c8902eb3b9d56742b2a938934504"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8781dd88d397d5fcaace66ec9a9c789946133c646ba0c4ba57e4a068ddb22d59",
      "request_id": "8781dd88d397d5fcaace66ec9a9c789946133c646ba0c4ba57e4a068ddb22d59",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "449448d08c190fbbd64583e20f9c00c3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年四站大满贯，菲斯只赢了一场比赛。可今年的年终名单里，第一次出现了他的名字。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a4969a115c8ccce3bc4edefeea7397afe4e6f747d026b8c267e222bce8f9e32a",
      "words_sha256": "bec5d9979ad70faa3b588683380a771130ced5a890bccb5094f91057bd149613"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:915f6f1b42af4984f86e8fb687408b035cfd731d720b0903672351fe49ac81a1",
      "request_id": "915f6f1b42af4984f86e8fb687408b035cfd731d720b0903672351fe49ac81a1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b388ccad275d2a819f72bc3dc580c396",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "菲斯年终路，从伤停到首次入围。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "02e7c59ed824cd6b9fdcdada7406fb498a3c1cfba8002695deb20c9f4db5d7c7",
      "words_sha256": "e797fe1d35493fa360319d71308b3d90ea7bb32793fad76c563fd7b53f0a06ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a7df54f9f3063186bfe7b0a5c5ccc40f0897f0153bc1be1b91dfea035fe5f196",
      "request_id": "a7df54f9f3063186bfe7b0a5c5ccc40f0897f0153bc1be1b91dfea035fe5f196",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2b1c57361098d0b079c72e3ff157d2b6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "去年法网后，背伤让他只又打了两场巡回赛单打。今年又缺席澳网，直到二月才开始新赛季。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "13ae0f5baff76503132a67ea8794d61e7233be0ec50921d36cb2b01c4c1a8e3e",
      "words_sha256": "72658152de18f186802284bcd1006bad09e10ecd7adefac0645bb302054a6d30"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5e79e5655e47efc2c0d3cee79eaeb80b9ff840b05900c74b39a6b72a62d8d70e",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
