        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "印第安维尔斯打进8强。接着是迈阿密，对保罗那场四分之一决赛，他救回四个赛点，三盘抢七翻了回来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "42e99bc27f7d3e1cddb73ec8597e1ef1bc605c0cc38d8838e9e0b0ca02cb6c3a",
      "words_sha256": "1476da5cbf15c9207eadec3f68851fa6b8a34479e616752c51abd62ded118c7c",
      "words_path": "voice_05.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8fdbe899728809f523e235d8750bcaa1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "迈阿密止步4强之后，他在巴塞罗那两盘击败卢布列夫。复出后的第一座奖杯，到手了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d5ba61562e03d28fe9cbef6046912f0478a519b3fd123d0672348d29e258c9cb",
      "words_sha256": "516d256161c3e35c388732c9fb4cf391d3f15a9badd53d7b54a3a9985da4ad62",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7c9e24fcca692767ea8fd533d4a868fc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "马德里，他又进了大师赛4强。复出之后，已经连续在大赛中走到后半程。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d9ae3f34769f382b41b825642700fdc2a3e5443a538a48b101b4580a847fb8c6",
      "words_sha256": "939ad6e4fcd671fb7ab3e7f17f16ed7f4493c8902eb3b9d56742b2a938934504",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d33f6112bbb1a3b51f971fdc0e79c966",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可伤病再次打断了他。罗马首战伤退，随后因为髋伤退出法网。两个大满贯，他都没能出场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7059c83e609abaa9eb9a53a63c1236e61f16a57b19320d4f763ab286a2c69e46",
      "words_sha256": "2aaf9b4087de99f86a6853e0272d55ce5706d1185a9a1dba1c8732d52efca6df",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "03267b61a0e0c1e0c9274c1c8d3d9b2e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "温网先赢一轮，第二轮输给贝雷蒂尼。这一胜，也是他今年全部的大满贯胜场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5f3410d9e1552254d62bc665154d742423202ef1eb0192793a857f1231697634",
      "words_sha256": "cad428dfcf32204297bd88905e467f0383b928857aed44db403efb8481e48b69",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "928200d63b4db8c445cdc353a9cfce30",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "辛辛那提决赛，他与蒂亚福各拿一盘。决胜盘，菲斯送出六比零，拿到生涯第一座大师赛冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6d12ca1aeb3653e8ee1c393612cf64ada5d231f63245898a50cd32f9551855d4",
      "words_sha256": "0a3aab9546ee395d461bcf05eff9451a25a4ab93ecfe83f7ca56611a13b685e4",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "05bc7cd67721621ca909fb8750e5c53f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网，却又在首轮被西西帕斯挡住。辛辛那提的冠军，并没有让大满贯的难题自动消失。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "947243cf285717be258dc02e1701b4e215af8dbd08cf1dc427f1893291bfd30f",
      "words_sha256": "4f32ec308029a1ad9fb895641c01e5f64718d0394b1b5a7cd9725d1058e3e36b",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6995f6757939319bd7064d0a59b37ca3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "秋天，东京打进8强、上海第三轮，布鲁塞尔又进4强。一站一站，把积分往上加。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1b644325e22f3d9dd860e10654c8cf4c7f71cc06f9572643f9044a0c5e7ef89b",
      "words_sha256": "48b7ca210e3f7814dd0f172f05738739b39b4b4c3b514e5b09a3201b0642c6b2",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "543601b81803674176271fe605e669cb",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "巴塞尔，面对弗里茨，第二盘零比二时，菲斯再次伤退。年终门票还没拿到，他又没能打完比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "275164136fb2f4aacbf305fbc6bc572d67d24f192970d43d8e87b14d71156b13",
      "words_sha256": "3e67bdfe7a316a9e4ea28c14b8096250d10f4265d01af6242560162f72dc5650",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "98985361b320f41252ebe75928a1dbe3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十一月四日，转折来自另一场比赛。阿利斯击败蒂亚福，菲斯的年终资格提前锁定。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b067e5bd2fb2d271c9d09b00bccd2e3587041717d56f4fb77e14442b1457eec8",
      "words_sha256": "1eff57b7b5c8887d7d3e90f3d0f32c4c33cbcdd93ac260074c193b61470dcb79",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "979842dfcdca26812a619fe6c7f40d48",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "截至十一月五日，菲斯三千六百二十五分，排在赛季积分榜第七。高亮的六个人，都已拿到年终门票。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "01ca48d89ee7a324e9c71d22e722c9a3440b8757262b1683bcc420de29fafb87",
      "words_sha256": "37f157f3ffef33a14db8223433c24262540b45b281b203ff8b844df12724459f",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "01ee08b93cf494bb55fbb1d7d9b9e70b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "资格到手之后，他又两盘击败马哈奇，继续巴黎的征程。法国男网时隔十年，终于又有人入围年终。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a034d831d14c130c9da25b7234f6a6f671c1026d165acac21c1129d756b1e6af",
      "words_sha256": "8e6d462876205c23ad3dd467c04a144e49010fe084a8db3965d380c367443a3a",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "eab151d930b8345cdc80b3fde10e2133",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "大满贯只有一胜，却拼出了第一张年终门票。第一次到都灵，你看好菲斯拿下几场胜利？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "02e7c59ed824cd6b9fdcdada7406fb498a3c1cfba8002695deb20c9f4db5d7c7",
      "words_sha256": "e797fe1d35493fa360319d71308b3d90ea7bb32793fad76c563fd7b53f0a06ba",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b388ccad275d2a819f72bc3dc580c396",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "菲斯年终路，从伤停到首次入围。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5e79e5655e47efc2c0d3cee79eaeb80b9ff840b05900c74b39a6b72a62d8d70e",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
}
